### 5. Real-World Application

In a real software company, a product manager may define a large feature as an Epic. Developers and QA engineers then work with smaller Stories and Tasks. Jira helps everyone track ownership and progress.

### 6. Key Takeaways
- Jira provides visibility into project activities.
- Epics organize large requirements.
- Stories represent user requirements.
- Tasks represent implementation activities.
- Bugs track unexpected application behaviour.

